{
  "meta": {
    "problem_id": "PLATE_GUIDED_COMPRESSION",
    "description": "Flat plate with all four lateral edges constrained only in z (guided: x and y free, z locked). Top face axial compression. Models a plate under buckling-precursor conditions where edges can slide in-plane.",
